{
  "title": "Secrets Manager · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "DB 비밀번호·API 키 같은 비밀 값을 저장·검색·교체하는 서비스다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Secrets Manager</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#secrets-and-versions\">Secrets and Versions</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#automatic-rotation\">Automatic Rotation</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#retrieval-and-client-side-caching\">Retrieval and Client-side Caching</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#iam-resource-policies-and-kms\">IAM, Resource Policies and KMS</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#replication-and-regional-recovery\">Replication and Regional Recovery</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#private-access-and-audit\">Private Access and Audit</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#parameter-store-comparison\">Parameter Store Comparison</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>보안</span><span>47 / 62</span></div><h1>Secrets Manager</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Secrets Manager는 Password, API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Key, DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Credential 같은 Secret의 저장·조회·Version·Rotation을 관리한다. Secret Value는 Encryption된 상태로 저장되며 앱은 권한을 가진 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 요청으로 필요한 값을 얻는다.</p><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a>는 Encryption Key를 관리하고 Secrets Manager는 앱이 사용할 Secret의 내용·Lifecycle을 관리한다. Secret을 Code·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>·Container Image에 고정하지 않고 Runtime 권한과 Cache·Rotation을 설계한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"조회와 Rotation\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>조회와 Rotation</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Runtime retrieval</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Application Role</strong><small>Secret 조회 권한</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Secrets Manager</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a>로 보호된 Value</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Client cache</strong><small>갱신·만료 관리</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Rotation</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>New secret version</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#secrets-and-versions\">AWSPENDING</a></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Target credential update</strong><small>DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>·외부 시스템 변경</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#secrets-and-versions\">AWSCURRENT</a></strong><small>검증 후 현재 Version 전환</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Secret Rotation과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> Key Rotation은 다른 값·절차를 관리한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"secrets-and-versions\"><h2>Secrets and Versions<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#secrets-and-versions\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Secret은 Metadata와 여러 Value Version을 가질 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#secrets-and-versions\">AWSCURRENT</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#secrets-and-versions\">AWSPREVIOUS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#secrets-and-versions\">AWSPENDING</a> 같은 Staging Label로 Rotation 단계를 구분한다. Version Label 변경과 실제 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Password 변경의 일관성을 유지해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"automatic-rotation\"><h2>Automatic Rotation<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#automatic-rotation\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 서비스의 Managed Rotation 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> 기반 Rotation을 사용한다. Single-user·Alternating-users 전략은 대상 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>와 앱 연결 방식에 따라 선택한다. Rotation Function이 대상 Network와 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>에 접근할 권한이 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"retrieval-and-client-side-caching\"><h2>Retrieval and Client-side Caching<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#retrieval-and-client-side-caching\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>앱은 SDK로 Secret을 조회하고 지원 Cache 도구로 지연·API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 비용을 줄일 수 있다. Cache 갱신·만료와 Rotation 후 재연결을 고려한다. 무기한 Cache하면 교체된 Credential 때문에 장애가 생길 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"iam-resource-policies-and-kms\"><h2>IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span>, Resource Policies and KMS <span class=\"full-name\">(Key Management Service)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#iam-resource-policies-and-kms\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Secret API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 권한과 Resource Policy로 접근을 제한한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/#aws-owned-aws-managed-and-customer-managed-keys\">Customer Managed Key</a> 사용 시 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> 권한도 필요하다. Secret의 이름·Tag·Log에 민감한 값이 노출되지 않도록 설계한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"replication-and-regional-recovery\"><h2>Replication and Regional Recovery<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#replication-and-regional-recovery\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 Secret을 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>으로 복제해 지역 앱·DR에서 사용한다. Primary·Replica의 관리·Rotation 관계를 확인한다. Secret 복제가 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 데이터·Network·앱까지 복구하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"private-access-and-audit\"><h2>Private Access and Audit<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#private-access-and-audit\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">Interface VPC Endpoint</a>로 인터넷 경로 없이 서비스 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>에 접근할 수 있다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\">Endpoint Policy</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>을 함께 확인한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>에서 Secret 관리·조회 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 활동을 감사한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"parameter-store-comparison\"><h2>Parameter Store Comparison<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#parameter-store-comparison\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Systems Manager <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#parameter-store-comparison\">Parameter Store</a>는 구성 값·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/#parameter-store-comparison\">SecureString</a> 저장에 사용한다. 지원 Tier·비용·Rotation 자동화 요구를 비교한다. 비밀 자동 교체가 핵심이면 Secrets Manager의 Rotation 기능이 직접적인 선택지가 된다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> Password를 Secret으로 저장하고 Rotation을 구성한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/\">ECS</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/containers/#task-role-and-execution-role\">Task Role</a>에는 해당 Secret 조회만 허용하고 앱은 갱신 시 새 Credential로 연결한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">암호화 키</a> 관리, Secrets Manager는 애플리케이션 비밀 관리가 핵심이다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/secretsmanager/latest/userguide/intro.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">secretsmanager/latest/userguide/intro.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q065/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q065\" data-question=\"Q065\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q065</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q065/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to store an application database password outside its code and rotate it periodically. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q065\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a KMS key alias</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q065\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q065\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q065\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Secrets Manager</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a>는 비밀 값의 저장·조회·교체에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q088\" data-question=\"Q088\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2,3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q088</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q088/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Lambda functions connect to a private RDS database. Which TWO services address connection spikes and secure storage of credentials?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Route 53 weighted record</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Secrets Manager</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS Proxy</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q088\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C, D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\">RDS Proxy</a>는 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 연결을 풀링하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a>는 비밀 값을 관리한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/secrets/\">Secrets Manager</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q062\" data-question=\"Q062\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q062</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q062/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A principal needs temporary access by assuming a role in another AWS account. Which API action is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 HealthCheck</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">STS AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only S3 PutObject</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q062\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EC2 AssociateAddress</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · AssumeRole은 역할의 임시 자격 증명을 얻는다. 양측 권한·신뢰 설정을 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q063\" data-question=\"Q063\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q063</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q063/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An IAM role policy allows an API action in a member account, but an organization SCP blocks that action. What is the result?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The IAM Allow takes precedence</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">VPC peering allows it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q063\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">The action is denied by the SCP restriction</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>는 최대 권한 경계다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>의 Allow만으로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/#service-control-policies\">SCP</a>의 제한을 넘을 수 없다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q068\" data-question=\"Q068\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q068</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q068/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An administrator needs to audit who called an API to change an IAM policy. Which service should be checked first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The size of files in EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q068\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch CPU metrics</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>은 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 활동 이력을 기록한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">이전 용어 <b>S3 Storage Classes</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">다음 용어 <b>Security Group</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
